768c3fc5b3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"つまりここでの会話も全て仕事…!!","ts":"1620823447.083000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"kiduki","count":2,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xsbnl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bce2267c-9e8e-4a80-b6dd-96e973f99b6a","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"ベンチャーだと何してるかわからない人まったくいないけど、大きな企業だったときはまじでいっぱいあったな・・・","ts":"1620823268.082500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IRgf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"737CFADE-2FFB-4280-BB12-647234A94810","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"人それぞれだと思いますけど、僕の場合は、家事育児以外で起きてるときは基本全部仕事してますね。布団入ってから寝るまでも、やれることをします。","ts":"1620823198.081500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d2z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"931e3367-0561-4834-9369-a123af5ac0f2","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"社員と役員じゃ仕事内容全然違うだろうから想像できない","ts":"1620823083.079500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=swmk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1cf95b49-99d4-4258-925d-2250851f57e8","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"便利 (そもそもいつ仕事するんだろ)","ts":"1620823065.079100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CHuS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"382A929C-2F4B-43FA-945C-2562FC73B667","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"基本的には入れないんですが、どうしても朝にミーティングが入ってしまったら、そこだけ起きて二度寝するか、徹夜して朝一のミーティングが終わってから寝るという技がありますね。","ts":"1620822994.078900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3lhQu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"709235c0-94d4-477b-9c00-e074d10d7cdf","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"まあでもミーティングがあったら起きないといけないのでは","ts":"1620822796.076500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false